{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 300,
    "dDurationMs": 2766,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "U.S. debt to GDP is almost as"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3066,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "high now\nas just after the Second World War."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6066,
    "dDurationMs": 4734,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And now Trump's tax cuts, foreign\npolicy adventures and proposal to double"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 10800,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the US defense budget\nare projected to push it way higher."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 15633,
    "dDurationMs": 3167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So is the US heading towards a debt\ncrisis?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 19666,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You'd think so."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 21066,
    "dDurationMs": 2067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But there's one big problem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 23133,
    "dDurationMs": 4633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "People have been warning about US debt\nfor literally decades now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 27900,
    "dDurationMs": 2733,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The national debt."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 30633,
    "dDurationMs": 3267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is a massive storm\nthat is clouding America's future."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 34066,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, that was a US TV spot from 1992,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 37666,
    "dDurationMs": 3334,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but also in 2006, Barack Obama warned us."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 41100,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Paul Ryan again did the same in 2011\nand before coming into"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 45900,
    "dDurationMs": 5033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "office, Trump Treasury Secretary Scott\nBassett openly stated that current US debt"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 50933,
    "dDurationMs": 5467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is fundamentally unsustainable\nand that taming it is why he took the job."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 56600,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But coming into office,\nBassett is currently overseeing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 60600,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "such a massive big spending increase\nthat the US Congressional Budget Office"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 65600,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "now predicts US debt to GDP\nwill go even higher than."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 69633,
    "dDurationMs": 2567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "After fighting a literal world war."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 72200,
    "dDurationMs": 3833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So when can we expect\nsomething will break?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 76066,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When will the US enter\nthe dreaded debt death spiral"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 79966,
    "dDurationMs": 5067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that hit Greece in 2012\nat 172% debt to GDP?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 85366,
    "dDurationMs": 4634,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Venezuela in 2017 at 160%, debt DB"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 90300,
    "dDurationMs": 4766,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and Sri Lanka in 2022 at 114% to GDP."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 95166,
    "dDurationMs": 4067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well,\nthis graph probably will not tell us."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 99400,
    "dDurationMs": 3833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You see, there's a big problem with\nhow we typically look at government debt."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 103300,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is\nwe do not know how much is too much."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 107233,
    "dDurationMs": 2167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There isn't even a clear pattern."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 109400,
    "dDurationMs": 3866,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You see, for Russia in 1998, 75%"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 113266,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of GDP was its breaking point\nfor Argentina."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 116266,
    "dDurationMs": 4734,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In 2001, it was about 65% of GDP and 40%."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 121000,
    "dDurationMs": 5300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Today, 250% of GDP seems just fine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 126333,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what does it tell us about this\nalarming trajectory of you as debt?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 131133,
    "dDurationMs": 2567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When will it genuinely be too high?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 133700,
    "dDurationMs": 3866,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To answer that question, we have to go\nbeyond what you usually hear in the media"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 137566,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and find out when do governments\nactually go bust?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 141566,
    "dDurationMs": 4534,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If we look at the five most high profile\ngovernment defaults of the last decade,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 146233,
    "dDurationMs": 3167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we can see that\nthey all had two things in common,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 149600,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it was not high debt to GDP."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 152766,
    "dDurationMs": 3534,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is, while Greece, Venezuela and Sri\nLankan depths"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 156466,
    "dDurationMs": 4034,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "were absolutely considered\nvery high by today's standards,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 160966,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Russian and Argentinean debts right before"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 164366,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "their collapse would be considered\nfairly low, fairly responsible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 168300,
    "dDurationMs": 3466,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Instead, what all these cases had in\ncommon was that they had very,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 171766,
    "dDurationMs": 4234,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "very high real interest rates\njust before they collapsed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 176166,
    "dDurationMs": 2734,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is here,\nyou see interest rates minus inflation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 178900,
    "dDurationMs": 2666,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is real interest rates\njust before the collapse."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 181566,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And while they vary quite a bit,\nI think it's fair to say"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 185066,
    "dDurationMs": 3034,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that any interest rate above 20%"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 188233,
    "dDurationMs": 3033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "would be considered really, really high."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 191300,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And remember that is interest rates\ncorrected for inflation,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 194500,
    "dDurationMs": 1066,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is very important"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 195566,
    "dDurationMs": 4434,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because if there is a lot of inflation,\ntax revenue tends to go up quickly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 200000,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "along with rising prices,\nwhich could make repaying debt easy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 204766,
    "dDurationMs": 4934,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So in practice, interest rates would often\nhave been way higher than inflation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 209866,
    "dDurationMs": 3167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These are indeed interest rates\nminus inflation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 213033,
    "dDurationMs": 3267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And while inflation is often\nassociated with too much government"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 216300,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "spending, as you can see\nhere, inflation in Venezuela and Sri"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 220300,
    "dDurationMs": 3966,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Lanka was indeed extremely high\njust before they collapsed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 224266,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But in Russia\nit was actually still at a manageable 6%."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 227866,
    "dDurationMs": 5967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And Argentina had deflation at -1.7%\nand Greece at 1.5%."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 233866,
    "dDurationMs": 3567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In this cases, inflation\nwould not have predicted a crash."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 237600,
    "dDurationMs": 4166,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So just to be clear, Russia, Argentina,\nGreece, Venezuela and Sri Lanka"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 241766,
    "dDurationMs": 3934,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "defaulted on their debts\nnot because they could not borrow anymore,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 245700,
    "dDurationMs": 5133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but rather because they could only borrow\nat such high ever increasing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 251200,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "interest rates that they'd have to borrow"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 254000,
    "dDurationMs": 4166,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "more and more just to keep paying\nthese ever increasing interest rates."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 258333,
    "dDurationMs": 4467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So at that point, they rather chose\nnot to borrow anymore at all."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 262933,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is not just me cherry picking\nfive examples that fit this narrative."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 266966,
    "dDurationMs": 4967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Economic research also does not find\nevidence that there exists a certain debt"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 271933,
    "dDurationMs": 3933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to GDP ratio, after which governments\nand their economies collapse,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 276200,
    "dDurationMs": 1433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "perhaps even stranger."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 277633,
    "dDurationMs": 4833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even a bad economy does not predict\na government debt default."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 282766,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On the other hand, what does predict\nwhether a government will soon"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 285466,
    "dDurationMs": 900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "default on their debt"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 286366,
    "dDurationMs": 4067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is interest rates that are rising faster\nthan government revenue, which forces"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 290433,
    "dDurationMs": 5067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "governments in what you could call\na self-fulfilling debt death spiral."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 295800,
    "dDurationMs": 3733,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And in such a spiral, higher interest\nrates, spending increases government debt."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 299700,
    "dDurationMs": 2733,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then investors see government debt\ngetting higher and higher"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 302433,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and therefore ask, of course,\na higher interest rate,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 305133,
    "dDurationMs": 3267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which in turn increases government debt\nand so forth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 308700,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And as you can see here for Greece,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 310100,
    "dDurationMs": 3166,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that self-fulfilling doom\nloop can actually explode"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 313266,
    "dDurationMs": 4267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "really quickly after a period\nin which everything looked quite fine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 317900,
    "dDurationMs": 1433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Once a country enters"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 319333,
    "dDurationMs": 3933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this state, it will be extremely difficult\nto get out of because most governments"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 323266,
    "dDurationMs": 4767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "cannot raise taxes fast enough\nwithout destroying the economy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 328500,
    "dDurationMs": 4433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this brings us to the only real way\nthat economists track debt sustainability."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 332966,
    "dDurationMs": 1534,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They simply compare."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 334500,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Interest rates\ncorrected for inflation are to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 339000,
    "dDurationMs": 3966,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "how fast the economy is growing,\ncorrected for inflation. Gee."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 343200,
    "dDurationMs": 1466,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And interestingly,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 344666,
    "dDurationMs": 3734,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if real interest rates are lower\nthan how fast the economy is growing,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 348600,
    "dDurationMs": 4033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the government can even reduce the debt\nover time quite quickly,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 352800,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "simply by running a balanced budget,\nexcluding interest rates."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 358266,
    "dDurationMs": 4034,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But once interest rates\nare bigger than growth,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 362300,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they start rising faster\nthan Texas can keep up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 365400,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then the government will really have\nto cut spending very quickly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 368900,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to avoid ending up in a death spiral."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 371900,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So can the US avoid such a dreaded debt\ndeath spiral?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 376300,
    "dDurationMs": 3233,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And how much longer can it\nkeep spending like this?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 379933,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is currently even more difficult\nto assess than normal,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 382733,
    "dDurationMs": 3767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because the US is in a massive\nAI spending boom right now, of which"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 386633,
    "dDurationMs": 3533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we still have to see the productivity\neffects in macroeconomic data."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 390666,
    "dDurationMs": 2667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But there certainly have been\na lot of super interesting"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 393333,
    "dDurationMs": 3333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "tools coming out,\nsuch as that of our advertising sponsor"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 396666,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Letaido by Ahrefs,\na major SEO and marketing platform."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 401700,
    "dDurationMs": 3466,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Whether you run a business blog\nor have any other online presence,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 405433,
    "dDurationMs": 2267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you know marketing is a lot of work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 407700,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Tracking what's working, finding content\nideas, keeping tabs on competitors,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 412233,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "writing reports."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 413633,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Whereas regular AI models\ncan do a lot in theory, in practice"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 417633,
    "dDurationMs": 3933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's incredibly difficult and tedious\nto feed them all the right data"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 421800,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the perfect prompt."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 423000,
    "dDurationMs": 3966,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is where Letaido comes\nin, which has unrestricted access"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 426966,
    "dDurationMs": 3834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to all Ahrefs data and, unlike standard\nagents,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 431066,
    "dDurationMs": 3367,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "has been specifically trained\nto be a marketing rockstar."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 434700,
    "dDurationMs": 3533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Letaido is a platform\nwhere AI agents actually do"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 438233,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the work for you 24/7, not a chat\nbot that just answers questions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 443366,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Agents that connect to your tools,\nunderstand your data, and ship"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 447400,
    "dDurationMs": 1233,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "finished results."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 448633,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For example, since my website was already"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 450633,
    "dDurationMs": 3933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "connected to Ahrefs,\nI could simply ask Letaido to do"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 454566,
    "dDurationMs": 4267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "an analysis on who links to my website,\nand Letaido immediately"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 458833,
    "dDurationMs": 4867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "gave me a fully up to date backlink\nprofile report explaining"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 463700,
    "dDurationMs": 3333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what's working well, what can be improved,\nand what I should do next."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 467100,
    "dDurationMs": 4066,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Finally, it gave follow up recommendations\nfor analysis to do next,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 471166,
    "dDurationMs": 4567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "such as optimizing my organic keywords\nor discovering content gaps."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 475900,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if you want to turbocharge\nyour marketing,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 478800,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "why not give Letaido\na try and use the link in the description"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 482300,
    "dDurationMs": 4366,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and top comment below to put an AI agent\nto work on your marketing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 486866,
    "dDurationMs": 2734,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But first,\nlet's get back to our core question."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 489600,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How can we know if us that is entering\ndeath spiral territory?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 493766,
    "dDurationMs": 1534,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's actually not that difficult."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 495300,
    "dDurationMs": 3833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We have to figure out first\nif interest rates correct it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 499133,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for inflation, are keeping up with\neconomic growth corrected for inflation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 503500,
    "dDurationMs": 3866,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So where is the US right now\nwhen it comes to real interest rates?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 507833,
    "dDurationMs": 3333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If we look at the average interest rate\nthe US government is currently paying"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 511166,
    "dDurationMs": 5234,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there just around 3.8% on average\non the debt they already have."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 516733,
    "dDurationMs": 5133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And because inflation is around 3.5%\npretty high, that means that real average"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 521866,
    "dDurationMs": 6167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "interest rates that they are currently\npaying is really only about 0.3%."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 528500,
    "dDurationMs": 3033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay, so what about economic growth\ncorrected for inflation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 531566,
    "dDurationMs": 767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, if we look"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 532333,
    "dDurationMs": 3967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at some of the latest projections\nthen this is estimated to be between"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 536466,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "1.5 to 2.5%."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 540600,
    "dDurationMs": 5066,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So real interest rates paid today\nare much lower than economic growth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 546133,
    "dDurationMs": 333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 546466,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We can breathe easy talking about US\ndebt doom"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 550866,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with current real interest rates around"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 553766,
    "dDurationMs": 3167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "0% looks almost like a joke."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 557166,
    "dDurationMs": 3834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "However, that's only looking at\ninterest rates right before the collapse."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 561333,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But that's not how it doom loop works."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 563233,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Remember what happened to Greek government\ndebt up to 2010?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 566633,
    "dDurationMs": 1867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Everything was looking quite fine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 568500,
    "dDurationMs": 2733,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Interest rates were just slowly going up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 571233,
    "dDurationMs": 3033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But of course, beneath the surface\nthings were not fine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 574266,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then suddenly interest rates exploded."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 577666,
    "dDurationMs": 2667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In the US,\nwe're starting to see a similar trend."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 580333,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sure, interest rates were going down\nand down and down,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 584133,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but ever since 2020,\nthey have slowly been going up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 587466,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The positive trend has reversed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 589866,
    "dDurationMs": 3034,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But something else\nmore worrying is going on now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 592933,
    "dDurationMs": 5567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Remember, US debt is now pretty high\nand therefore interest rate payments"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 598500,
    "dDurationMs": 4066,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as a share of the economy\nhave really exploded"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 602566,
    "dDurationMs": 4634,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are now back up to the highs\nthat they were in the 1990s."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 607200,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When that worrying clip was made\nthat I showed you previously."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 611300,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In fact, the US government is now\nspending more on interest"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 615000,
    "dDurationMs": 5566,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "rate payments every year than it is\nspending on its massive military."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 620633,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "14% of spending."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 622633,
    "dDurationMs": 2567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's more than it spends\non education, infrastructure"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 625200,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and scientific research and administration\ncombined."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 629066,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So debt to GDP matters."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 631566,
    "dDurationMs": 3434,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "After all,\nit just does not matter on its own."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 635000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It matters if you take it together\nwith rising interest rates for yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 639000,
    "dDurationMs": 1033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now you may say,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 641033,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But what about Japan?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 642633,
    "dDurationMs": 5533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, unlike the US,\nJapan has a lot of financial assets"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 648466,
    "dDurationMs": 3634,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and these will help\nit keep its interest rate bill manageable."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 652133,
    "dDurationMs": 6067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And while the US net debt,\nthe gray bar, is lower than 100% of GDP,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 658566,
    "dDurationMs": 3467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this does not change our analysis\nin this case because we have seen that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 662033,
    "dDurationMs": 4667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what really matters is interest\nrate payments needed to service that debt."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 666866,
    "dDurationMs": 3934,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And there, the Committee for a Responsible\nFederal Budget has calculated that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 671233,
    "dDurationMs": 2633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "either with current or with higher"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 673866,
    "dDurationMs": 3234,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "future interest\nrates, the interest rate cost"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 677100,
    "dDurationMs": 4566,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "trajectory is about to swallow more\nand more of the US budget."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 682000,
    "dDurationMs": 3966,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even overtaking Medicare by 2029."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 686100,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is why outgoing Fed Chair Jerome\nPowell said that the level of our debt"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 691200,
    "dDurationMs": 2233,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "relative to the economy\nis not unsustainable."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 693433,
    "dDurationMs": 1533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The path is unsustainable."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 694966,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And worryingly, investors seem to agree."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 697466,
    "dDurationMs": 1234,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Remember that if I compare"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 698700,
    "dDurationMs": 3666,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "current real interest rates to growth,\neverything looks fine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 702366,
    "dDurationMs": 3767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if you look at ten year so-called\nTreasury inflation protected securities,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 706433,
    "dDurationMs": 3833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we can deduce that investors\nbelieve that future interest rates"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 710266,
    "dDurationMs": 5900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "corrected for inflation\nwill likely be about 2.15%."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 716500,
    "dDurationMs": 3466,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Meanwhile, as you remember, most\nprofessional forecasters believe the US"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 719966,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "economy is likely to grow around\n2% in the same period."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 724866,
    "dDurationMs": 2934,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So US debt is currently fine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 727800,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if we plug expected future rates\ninto the main economic indicators"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 731800,
    "dDurationMs": 3466,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for debt sustainability,\nwe can see that there are now strong signs"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 735266,
    "dDurationMs": 3567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that the US is heading towards a debt\ndeath spiral"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 738900,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if it continues its current\nspending plans."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 742433,
    "dDurationMs": 4267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So in conclusion,\nis the US heading towards a debt crisis?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 746733,
    "dDurationMs": 4467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. If it continues on its current\nspending path, then interest rate payments"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 751200,
    "dDurationMs": 2466,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "will start getting so high\nthat the US government"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 753666,
    "dDurationMs": 4367,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "will either have to take drastic actions\nor face a debt spiral."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 758300,
    "dDurationMs": 1766,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But when will that debt spiral come?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 760066,
    "dDurationMs": 1700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We cannot know for sure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 761766,
    "dDurationMs": 2767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In that way, it's\nreally a bit like a bubble like Bitcoin"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 764533,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in 2017 or the Chinese housing bubble\nin the 20 tens."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 767700,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In both cases, most economists agreed\nthat this was unsustainable,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 771600,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that it was a bubble."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 772800,
    "dDurationMs": 4533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "However, they were unable to predict\nexactly when the bubble would pop."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 777566,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Similarly, today, if the massive AI\nspending is justified and the US economy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 781466,
    "dDurationMs": 4467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "will soon grow by even more, then\nthe US may continue spending like this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 786233,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And actually, debt to GDP will be fine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 788833,
    "dDurationMs": 3567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On the other hand, if it is a bubble\nand it pops, then US government"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 792400,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "spending will look even more unsustainable\nthan it already looks today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 796300,
    "dDurationMs": 2066,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Making a debt crisis come sooner."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 798366,
    "dDurationMs": 2634,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But okay,\nlet's address the elephant in the room."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 801000,
    "dDurationMs": 3133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What will the debt\ncrisis actually look like?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 804233,
    "dDurationMs": 3733,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here I do think the Venezuela, Argentina,\nRussia, Greece comparisons"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 808166,
    "dDurationMs": 1300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are a bit misleading."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 809466,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You see, these are relatively simple\neconomies that have historically either"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 813766,
    "dDurationMs": 4034,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "borrowed a lot in foreign currencies\nor had locked in their currency,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 817800,
    "dDurationMs": 5066,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like Greece, to the euro or Argentina\nto the dollar, or depended heavily"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 822866,
    "dDurationMs": 4967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on a single commodity for their income,\nlike Russia in 1998 or Venezuela in 2017."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 828000,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Meanwhile, the US has a fairly well\ndiversified economy with many companies"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 832300,
    "dDurationMs": 3366,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that genuinely dominate\nthe rest of the world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 835766,
    "dDurationMs": 2967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And of course, crucially,\nbecause the US issues the world's"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 838733,
    "dDurationMs": 3667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "reserve currency, it's\nunlike Greece, Venezuela and Lanka"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 842900,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "has essentially\njust borrowed in its own currency."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 845933,
    "dDurationMs": 5500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Therefore, I think if the US finds itself\nin this debt death spiral,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 851433,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it will more likely adjust similarly to\nhow Britain did after the Second World War"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 856433,
    "dDurationMs": 4733,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by forcing financial institutions\nto keep interest rates low, while fairly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 861166,
    "dDurationMs": 3834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "high inflation, but nothing like\nhyperinflation, erodes the debt."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 865333,
    "dDurationMs": 3267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Notably,\nthis meant that Britons did suffer,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 868766,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but due to its geopolitical heft."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 871800,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Britain had this thing\ncalled the sterling zone,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 875200,
    "dDurationMs": 4566,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it essentially, for some allies\nand former colonies to share the pain."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 879900,
    "dDurationMs": 3233,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if the US has to adjust,\nI think it's more likely"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 883366,
    "dDurationMs": 2967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "not to be a spectacular Venezuela\nstyle blowup,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 886333,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but rather a painful period\nof much higher inflation,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 889633,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but not hyperinflation\nthat will slowly erode much of US debt,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 894100,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "making both US citizens and in this case,\nthe world, who heavily uses"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 899300,
    "dDurationMs": 4066,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the dollar as a reserve and investment\nGuernsey significantly poorer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 903733,
    "dDurationMs": 2567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But yeah, that's my take.\nWhat do you think?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 906300,
    "dDurationMs": 1666,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let me know in the comments below."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 907966,
    "dDurationMs": 2034,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And finally,\nif you are heading a marketing team"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 910000,
    "dDurationMs": 2133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and if you are interested\nin putting an agent"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 912133,
    "dDurationMs": 4367,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to work on your marketing, consider\nchecking out our sponsor Lotito via"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 916500,
    "dDurationMs": 600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the link below."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 917100,
    "dDurationMs": 2866,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It really helps out the\nchannel if you use our link."
    } ]
  } ]
}
